{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463504",
      "title": "Validating Props",
      "lectureOrder": 96,
      "videoOrder": 82,
      "sourceHash": "7c42634375acfe27bdb701fb8be3c6516672a1d4fd36a3e321818472b3d5aacd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 5.063,
          "en": "So props are important as you can tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.23,
          "end": 9.32,
          "en": "and thus far we're specifying props like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.32,
          "end": 12.77,
          "en": "as an array of the props we expect to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.77,
          "end": 15.96,
          "en": "where every prop is just added as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 17.21,
          "en": "I mentioned that this would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.21,
          "end": 19.69,
          "en": "the bare minimum configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.69,
          "end": 21.82,
          "en": "With that view will let you know about the props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.82,
          "end": 22.98,
          "en": "you expect to get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 25.743,
          "en": "but you don't provide any other information to view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.84,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "This is okay, especially for simple apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.16,
          "en": "or simple components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.16,
          "end": 33.36,
          "en": "but for more complex components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 36.49,
          "en": "and especially when working in a team for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.49,
          "end": 38.65,
          "en": "you might want to share more information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.65,
          "end": 40.16,
          "en": "about your props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.16,
          "end": 42.94,
          "en": "Simply, so that view can let you know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.94,
          "end": 45.8,
          "en": "if you pass incorrect data to a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.8,
          "end": 48.453,
          "en": "or if you forgot some required prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.39,
          "end": 53.72,
          "en": "And for that, you can replace this array of props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.72,
          "end": 56.41,
          "en": "actually I'll copy it and comment it out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.41,
          "end": 59.02,
          "en": "so that you'll still have it for reference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.02,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "you can replace it with an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 63.89,
          "en": "And in that object, you now have your props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.89,
          "end": 66.86,
          "en": "as JavaScript property names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.86,
          "end": 69.48,
          "en": "and then certain values for them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.48,
          "end": 73.21000000000001,
          "en": "And here the most basic extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.21000000000001,
          "end": 76.87,
          "en": "you could provide is the type of data you expect to get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.87,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "For example, string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 82.32,
          "en": "To make it clear that the value of the main prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.32,
          "end": 83.78,
          "en": "should be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.78,
          "end": 86.73,
          "en": "And if instead a number would be provided,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 88.543,
          "en": "we would get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "Side note, I'm speaking of a number type being provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.99000000000001,
          "end": 96.1,
          "en": "Not text that contains a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.1,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "That would of course be okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "since it would be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 101.27000000000001,
          "en": "So we can do that instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.27000000000001,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "and now make it clear that all our data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "at the moment, at least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 108.17,
          "en": "is getting a string like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.17,
          "end": 110.44,
          "en": "So now we're saying that this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.44,
          "end": 113.86,
          "en": "will get a name, a phone number, an email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.86,
          "end": 115.82,
          "en": "and the isFavorite prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.82,
          "end": 119.19,
          "en": "and every prop should get a value of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "Enhance does of course works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 123.403,
          "en": "but now we provide more information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.62,
          "end": 127.47,
          "en": "But you can be even more detailed than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.47,
          "end": 130.52,
          "en": "Instead of just providing that type here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.52,
          "end": 133.54,
          "en": "you can provide an object as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.54,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "for the prop you're expecting to get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 138.42000000000002,
          "en": "And in this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.42000000000002,
          "end": 143.42000000000002,
          "en": "you now can add a type, property, which holds the type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "of the prop you wanna get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 147.61,
          "en": "but you can also add more properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.61,
          "end": 149.94,
          "en": "Now not any properties of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.94,
          "end": 153.17000000000002,
          "en": "instead specific properties view will look for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.17000000000002,
          "end": 156.97,
          "en": "for example type, but also required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.97,
          "end": 160.49,
          "en": "To indicate whether this prop, the name prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.49,
          "end": 162.55,
          "en": "should be required or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.55,
          "end": 165.22,
          "en": "And this should be true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.22,
          "end": 166.86,
          "en": "So here we could make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.86,
          "end": 170.23,
          "en": "that this component, the friend contact component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.23,
          "end": 173.433,
          "en": "needs a name prop, this is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.19,
          "end": 177.71,
          "en": "And we can do the same, of course, for the other props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.71,
          "end": 181.403,
          "en": "Type string, and the phone number is also required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 182.63,
          "end": 184.41,
          "en": "And also for the email address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 184.41,
          "end": 186.993,
          "en": "We want to get a string and this required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.06,
          "end": 191.52,
          "en": "Now let's say the isFavorite prop is also a type string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 192.993,
          "en": "but it's not required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.28,
          "end": 198.88,
          "en": "In that case, if you have a non-required prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.88,
          "end": 200.96,
          "en": "you can add a default key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.96,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "where you provide a default value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 206.6,
          "en": "which will be used if the prop should be missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.6,
          "end": 209.77,
          "en": "So here for example, zero, so that by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 209.77,
          "end": 212.393,
          "en": "this component is not a favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.64,
          "end": 216.5,
          "en": "Default can also be a function by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.5,
          "end": 219.91,
          "en": "where you could have a more complex code snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.91,
          "end": 222.35,
          "en": "that executes to derive the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.35,
          "end": 226.223,
          "en": "But here I'll just set this to zero as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.15,
          "end": 230.65,
          "en": "You can also add a validator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.65,
          "end": 232.39,
          "en": "which holds a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.39,
          "end": 235.07,
          "en": "which should return true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.07,
          "end": 237.53,
          "en": "This validator function will get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.53,
          "end": 240.16,
          "en": "the value provided for the prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.16,
          "end": 243.85,
          "en": "and then you can have any validation object of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.85,
          "end": 246.77,
          "en": "to find out whether that's a valid value or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.77,
          "end": 249.24,
          "en": "So here for isFavorite for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.24,
          "end": 252.6,
          "en": "we could check if value is equal to one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 256.33,
          "en": "or if value is equal to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.33,
          "end": 258.53,
          "en": "and that will be able for a yield true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.53,
          "end": 260.61,
          "en": "if either of the two is correct,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.61,
          "end": 263.72,
          "en": "or false, if we get a totally different value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.72,
          "end": 266.27,
          "en": "So with that we could make sure that really only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.27,
          "end": 269.14300000000003,
          "en": "the values one and zero are allowed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.62,
          "end": 272.97,
          "en": "And what's the whole idea behind that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 272.97,
          "end": 276.64,
          "en": "Well, with that more detailed configuration here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 276.64,
          "end": 279.75,
          "en": "we can go to the place where we use our component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.75,
          "end": 283.1,
          "en": "and for example omit isFavorite, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 283.1,
          "end": 285.713,
          "en": "on the second component here, on Julie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.73,
          "end": 290.07,
          "en": "With that, the app still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.07,
          "end": 295.07,
          "en": "because we made this prop isFavorite non-required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.48,
          "end": 299.023,
          "en": "it's optional, we have a default fallback value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.99,
          "end": 304.27,
          "en": "On the other hand, if I remove the name here and save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.27,
          "end": 306.3,
          "en": "we don't get an error here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.3,
          "end": 308.14,
          "en": "but if we open up the developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.14,
          "end": 310.12,
          "en": "and the JavaScript consol here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 310.12,
          "end": 312,
          "en": "we get a warning by view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312,
          "end": 315.04,
          "en": "that we got a missing required prop name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.04,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "And that helps us as a developer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 321.45,
          "en": "to spot such mistake quicker during development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 321.45,
          "end": 324.04,
          "en": "And we don't have to guess why the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 324.04,
          "end": 325.77,
          "en": "now is not working anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 325.77,
          "end": 327.74,
          "en": "Instead, we get a clear warning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 327.74,
          "end": 329.97,
          "en": "So that's very useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 329.97,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "And let's bring back that name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 336.28,
          "en": "If I provide an invalid value for isFavorite, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 336.28,
          "end": 338.57,
          "en": "we got the invalid prop warning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 338.57,
          "end": 341.43,
          "en": "because our custom validator check failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 341.43,
          "end": 343.93,
          "en": "We didn't provide one or zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 343.93,
          "end": 347.49,
          "en": "but instead 100, which is simply not valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 347.49,
          "end": 349.53,
          "en": "as specified here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 349.53,
          "end": 352.95,
          "en": "So you can have more complex prop definitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 352.95,
          "end": 356.473,
          "en": "to make sure that your component really gets used correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 358.15999999999997,
          "end": 360.84,
          "en": "Now ultimately, of course, it's your component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 360.84,
          "end": 363.53,
          "en": "so it's up to you how detailed you wanna be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 363.53,
          "end": 366.95,
          "en": "If you have an entire project on which you work on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 366.95,
          "end": 370.06,
          "en": "you might not need those more detailed configurations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 370.06,
          "end": 372.09,
          "en": "because you know all your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 372.09,
          "end": 373.943,
          "en": "and all your props anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 374.87,
          "end": 377.84,
          "en": "But if you're sharing your component with other people,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 377.84,
          "end": 379.63,
          "en": "as a third-party package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 379.63,
          "end": 381.81,
          "en": "or because you're working in a team,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 381.81,
          "end": 383.25,
          "en": "you might want to provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 383.25,
          "end": 385.72,
          "en": "such more detailed prop definitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
